    "detailed_description": "Wayland is sent from the west to try and help the town of Vormon with their goblin problem.<br />\r\nBefore he knows it he is wrapped up in a much larger conflict.<br />\r\nA powerful wizard called the Primagen is attempting to piece together ancient scrolls <br />\r\nto summon a demon into the world. Join Wayland in his journey to stop the Primagen,<br />\r\nbefore the world is doomed.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDemon Scrolls is not attempting to reinvent the wheel.<br />\r\nThis is a classic story with classic gameplay.<br />\r\nThe game is straight forward and easy to comprehend.<br />\r\nIf you enjoy killing monsters and finding treasure then this game<br />\r\ncould be a good fit for you.<br />\r\nPlayers can expect over 20 hours of gameplay.<br />\r\n(Single Player RPG)",
    "about_the_game": "Wayland is sent from the west to try and help the town of Vormon with their goblin problem.<br />\r\nBefore he knows it he is wrapped up in a much larger conflict.<br />\r\nA powerful wizard called the Primagen is attempting to piece together ancient scrolls <br />\r\nto summon a demon into the world. Join Wayland in his journey to stop the Primagen,<br />\r\nbefore the world is doomed.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDemon Scrolls is not attempting to reinvent the wheel.<br />\r\nThis is a classic story with classic gameplay.<br />\r\nThe game is straight forward and easy to comprehend.<br />\r\nIf you enjoy killing monsters and finding treasure then this game<br />\r\ncould be a good fit for you.<br />\r\nPlayers can expect over 20 hours of gameplay.<br />\r\n(Single Player RPG)",
    "short_description": "Stop the Primagen before he can find the Demon Scrolls to usher in an Age of Darkness in this Single Player RPG",
